Cleansing brush has a head of 16 small bristles in a line, with each bristle is 1 cm long. It is used for cleaning the face, neck and body. There are two versions of the face cleansing brush — disposable and rechargeable model that can be charged over the water via USB cable.
A cleansing brush is a skin-care tool that has a soft-bristled head that can easily remove the dirt and debris from the skin. Brushing the skin in a circular motion, cleans the pores, leaving the skin softer, smoother, and more glowing.
